A classless file of nothing but :PROCEDURE blocks: the shape of an include
library whose procedures compile inside an inheriting :CLASS via :INCLUDE.
Base: and Me: here report at the warning tier, not error
(diag.base_outside_class and diag.me_outside_class, issues #171 and #255).
-- input.ssl --
/* Shared helpers pasted into widget classes with :INCLUDE;
:PROCEDURE RefreshAll;
	Base:Refresh();
	Me:nRefreshCount += 1;
	:RETURN Me:nRefreshCount;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE ResetAll;
	Me:nRefreshCount := 0;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
/* Shared helpers pasted into widget classes with :INCLUDE;
:PROCEDURE RefreshAll;
	Base:Refresh();
	Me:nRefreshCount += 1;

	:RETURN Me:nRefreshCount;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE ResetAll;
	Me:nRefreshCount := 0;
:ENDPROC;
